  "description": "Have a blast while honing your scooter skills with the Trace 120 Folding Scooter by Mongoose. The Trace 120 scooter features Full-coverage MaxGrip™ on the lightweight alloy deck and steel brake to ensure a secure, stable ride, while durable bike-style grips offer superior handling. The 120 mm wheels come with ABEC – 7 bearings for long lasting use. Plus, the included kickstand provides convenient upright parking to protect the grips and frame from damage. And when it’s time to pack up for the day, the Trace folds for convenient storage and transport. This scooter can accommodate a wide variety of riders thanks to the quick-release adjustable height, complete with three lock-in pins, and a heavy-duty frame supports that up to 176 lbs. Get performance, convenience, and fun with the Trace 120.",
